{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10527","headline":"送蔡少府赴登州推事 · 高适","name":"送蔡少府赴登州推事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胶东连即墨，莱水入沧溟。\n国小常多事，人讹屡抵刑。\n公才徵郡邑，诏使出郊垧。\n标格谁当犯，风谣信可听。\n峥嵘大岘口，逦迤汶阳亭。\n地迥云偏白，天秋山更青。\n祖筵方卜昼，王事急侵星。\n劝尔将爲德，斯言盖有听。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}